; ============================================================================
;  Addon Insights  -  manifest (.addon)
; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
;  NAMING: the folder and this file are named "AddonInsights" -- letters only,
;  no spaces and no leading special character, which is what the console
;  uploader expects. The human-readable name lives in ## Title below.
;
;  The add-on's internal name (used by the code) = this file name without the
;  extension = the folder name = "AddonInsights".
;
;  CONSOLE NOTES:
;   * Console reads ".addon" only; ".txt" is ignored.
;   * Only the first ".addon" in the folder loads; no nested subfolders.
;   * PlayStation paths are case-sensitive, so the file names listed at the
;     bottom must match the real files exactly.
; ============================================================================

## Title: Addon Insights
## Author: spoqster
## Version: 1.8.0
## AddOnVersion: 180

; APIVersion(s): "current + previous patch". Verify the live value on PC with
;   /script d(GetAPIVersion())
; or check esoui.com, then update the first number before re-uploading.
## APIVersion: 101049 101047

## SavedVariables: AddonInsightsSavedVars

; LibAddonMenu-2.0 powers the entry under Settings > Add-ons, but we deliberately
; do NOT declare it as a dependency: OptionalDependsOn would delay our load until
; after LAM, and we want to start measuring add-on load times as early as
; possible. Instead the Lua detects LAM at runtime -- registering the panel now
; if LAM is already up, or deferring until LAM's own load event fires.

## Description: DO NOT INSTALL - ADDON UNDER ACTIVE DEVELOPMENT -- Lists installed addons, flags orphaned libraries, and tracks per-addon startup load time. Opens from the Add-ons menu, the /addoninsights command, or a mappable keybind.

; ---- Load order: Lua first (defines handlers + binding strings), then bindings.
AddonInsights.lua
Bindings.xml
